# Meet household needs

<h2 id="wg-001">Start with the household task</h2>

Say who needs the content and what they want to do. Put that first and cut the rest.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Hallway motion sensor diagnostics | Check the hallway motion sensor |

<h2 id="wg-002">Change only what Civica owns</h2>

Rewrite Civica labels and help. Never rewrite a native Home Assistant label, a translation or a name someone gave a device. If a native term is unfamiliar, explain it beside the term.

<%= example('wg-scope') %>

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Nain’s Lamp is unavailable | Nain’s lamp is unavailable |

The name stays exactly as the household typed it.
